<</ActualText(Reselling with Soda City Spirit)/K 11/P 3926 0 R/Pg 3334 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
3875 0 obj
<</ActualText(Founded in 2024 by local fashion curators, Cola Clothes is our response to fast-fashion waste. We realized that Columbia has an incredible community of style enthusiasts who love high-quality garments but wanted an easy, safe way to keep their closets cir\
cular.)/K 12/P 3927 0 R/Pg 3334 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
3876 0 obj
<</ActualText(Our mission is localresell first. Whether you meet your neighbors at the local weekly market or choose carbon-neutral shipping, every purchase supports a sustainable future for South Carolina fashion.)/K 13/P 3928 0 R/Pg 3334 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
